Every applicant for a license under this division or licensee requesting renewal of an existing license to operate a business wherein a billiard room will be operated shall provide to the city clerk an affidavit, sworn to before an officer authorized by law to administer oaths, stating that he:
(1) Is a citizen of the United States;
(2) Has not been convicted of a felony;
(3) Will not permit vagrants or persons under the influence of intoxicating liquors or controlled substances to enter or play billiards in his business establishment;
(4) Will have personal charge and management of the business;
(5) Will not permit gambling nor permit the billiard tables to be used in any manner other than as provided by law.
